body: "Observed while importing a new GitHub report on the current 2026.10.11 checkout. A JSON external_ref fails before creation; source URL intake succeeds when retained in body. The recommended update --external-ref fails as declared_nowhere. Verify the intended SDK/CLI external-reference write contract and provide a reachable recovery; do not invent a flag, add a blanket field override, or weaken reserved-field guards."
